		<label>prehensile wristblade</label>
		<description>Two wristblades attached together with a hinge at the center to create a rudimentary grip, ready to be attached to a gauntlet.</description>
		<descriptionHyperlinks>
			<HediffDef>ABYautja_PrehensileWristblades</HediffDef>
